   "Usage"], Cell["Details", "NotesSection"],
  Cell[TextData[{"ConstructiveAmplitude[coupling,numerator,denominator] \
represents coupling numerator/denominator. It appears in earlier model and \
symbolic-manipulation workflows."}], "Notes"],
  Cell[TextData[{"The current preparation and completion workflow normally \
uses a pair {massRules,expression} or the ordinary expression itself, rather \
than requiring this wrapper. Follow the input format shown on ",
     ButtonBox["PrepareAmplitudes", BaseStyle -> "Link",
      ButtonData -> "paclet:HEPCAT/ref/PrepareAmplitudes"],
     " for a new calculation."}], "Notes"],
  Cell[TextData[{"When inspecting an older expression, keep its coupling and \
denominator while manipulating the numerator. A wrapper's presence does not \
establish a diagram-specific on-shell assumption or validate the amplitude."}]\
, "Notes"], Cell["Examples", "PrimaryExamplesSection"],
  Cell[CellGroupData[{Cell["Load HEPCAT if needed", "ExampleSubsection"],
     Cell["Skip this setup if HEPCAT is already loaded. These examples assume \
the checkout is in ~/code/hepcat; change the paths if yours is elsewhere. \
Evaluate loading in its own cell before the calculation.", "ExampleText"],
     Cell[BoxData[RowBox[{"Get", "[", "\"~/code/hepcat/source/HEPCAT.wl\"",
         "]", ";"}]], "Input", InitializationCell -> True]}, Closed]],
  Cell["Basic Examples", "ExampleSection"],
  Cell[TextData[{"Inspect the stored fields."}], "ExampleText"],
  Cell[BoxData[RowBox[{"List", " ", "@@", " ", "ConstructiveAmplitude", "[",
      "g", ",", " ", "n", ",", " ", "d", "]"}]], "Input"],
  Cell[BoxData[RowBox[{"{", "g", ",", " ", "n", ",", " ", "d", "}"}]],
   "Output"],
  Cell[TextData[{"Convert the wrapper to an ordinary expression."}],
   "ExampleText"], Cell[BoxData[RowBox[{"ConstructiveAmplitude", "[", "g",
      ",", " ", "n", ",", " ", "d", "]", " ", "/.", " ",
      "ConstructiveAmplitude", "[", "c", "_", ",", " ", "n", "_", ",", " ",
      "d", "_", "]", " ", ":>", " ", "c", " ", "n", "/", "d"}]], "Input"],
  Cell[BoxData[RowBox[{"(", "g", "*", "n", ")", "/", "d"}]], "Output"],
  Cell["See Also", "SeeAlsoSection"],
  Cell[TextData[{ButtonBox["SquareAmplitude", BaseStyle -> "Link",
